<title>GERMANY: Commerzbank - Double-digit 97 profit growth possible.</title>
<headline>Commerzbank - Double-digit 97 profit growth possible.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-05-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Commerzbank chief executive Martin Kohlhaussen said on Friday that he regarded a double-digit percentage rise in operating profit as possible in 1997, but added that it was still early on in the year.</p>
<p>&quot;I regard double-digit percentage rate as possible,&quot; Kohlhaussen said in response to shareholders' questions at the group's annual shareholders' meeting.</p>
<p>In 1996, operating profit after risk provisions rose to 1.86 billion marks ($1.1 billion) from 1.45 billion marks.</p>
<p>--David Crossland, Frankfurt Newsroom +49 69 756525 ($ = 1.700 German Marks)</p>
